<title>RUSSIA: Rouble eases to 3,555 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble eases to 3,555 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble eased to 3,555 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,550 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 14		  Oct 11</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,555		   3,550</p>
<p> Volume traded (million DEM)    0.97		    3.56</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
